  ('Antik dünyanın yedi harikasından biri olan dev deniz feneri hangi şehirdeydi?', 'The giant lighthouse that was one of the Seven Wonders of the Ancient World stood in which city?', '["Alexandria","Carthage","Syracuse","Halicarnassus"]'::jsonb),
  ('Rivayete göre Roma İmparatoru Caligula hangi hayvanını konsül yapmayı planlamıştır?', 'According to legend, which of his animals did the Roman emperor Caligula plan to make a consul?', '["His horse","His dog","His cat","His monkey"]'::jsonb),
