  ('Girit''te Minotor''un hapsedildiği labirenti tasarlayan usta kimdir?', 'Which master craftsman designed the labyrinth on Crete in which the Minotaur was kept?', '["Daedalus","Theseus","Minos","Talos"]'::jsonb),
  ('Yunan mitolojisinde sonsuza dek bir kayayı tepeye yuvarlamaya mahkûm edilen kimdir?', 'In Greek mythology, who was condemned to roll a boulder up a hill for all eternity?', '["Sisyphus","Tantalus","Prometheus","Atlas"]'::jsonb),
  ('Jelibonlarıyla ünlü Haribo hangi ülkenin şirketidir?', 'Haribo, famous for its gummy sweets, is a company from which country?', '["Germany","Denmark","Belgium","Switzerland"]'::jsonb)
